---
// Startup programs Jerry has been accepted into, as inline monochrome marks (no requests, nothing on the LCP path).
// Sources: simple-icons 16.35 (CC0) for Google, NVIDIA, ElevenLabs, Deepgram; Microsoft's four-square mark (Wikimedia Commons copy
// of the official logo); Draper University's own site logo (draperuniversity.com). LAUNCH has no public SVG, so it is a wordmark.
---
<section class="programs" aria-labelledby="startup-programs">
  <h2 id="startup-programs">Startup programs</h2>
  <div class="programs-row" data-proto-tooltip>
